WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.141
The generalized Mukai conjecture.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.896
For a Fano manifold, rho times iota

3
00:00:04.896 --> 00:00:06.992
minus one is at most its dimension.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.318
Curve counts through a point give rho

5
00:00:11.318 --> 00:00:13.835
eigenvalues of quantum multiplication, forcing the bound.

6
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.970
Claimed: true for every smooth Fano manifold.

7
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.021
No Lean proof yet.
